    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The red-team attack composer paired with a same-event ALLOW/BLOCK reveal creates a coherent, recognizable demo narrative across all three viewports. Cyan/magenta encoding, the 100 risk verdict, and evidence-layer bars reinforce the defense-lab identity. However, most of the visual vocabulary remains familiar dashboard material—selects, sliders, progress bars, badges, and bordered cards—and the global header is a dense numbered rail rather than a distinctive signature element.",
